Full license: original_many_record_input.LICENSE in this directory.

Attributed original scenarios:
- tests/core/test_native_compact_suffix.py:
  NativeCompactSuffixTests.test_lossless_storage_and_ordered_faults_without_cpython
- tests/native/compact_suffix.cpp, including all storage, range, randomized and
  arbitrary manual suffix/frame cases and its independent set-valued oracle.
- tests/core/test_native_global_fastpath.py:
  NativeGlobalFastpathTests.test_shared_immutable_faults_keep_distinct_records_and_batch_scope

Rust adaptations retain explicit declared dimensions and omega rather than i
phase exponents. Additional compiler, buffer, high-word, true/report, lifetime,
strict-input and error-prefix guards test the independent public Rust APIs.
The manual suffix fixture adapter is not a substitute Clifford compiler.
No CPython or Native ABI is required by the Rust test target.
